  "question": "By interchanging the given two numbers (not digits), which of the following equations will be correct?\n\n44 and 19\n\nI. 203 + 44 - 27 × 19 ÷ 11 = 114\n\nII. 9 × 572 ÷ 19 - 44 + 4 = 120",
